    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The [[lookup @name]] releases spores at a Medium or Small corpse within [[lookup @range.value activity=ruh9QGSrxWb57Iuf]] feet of it that wasn't a Construct or an Undead. In 24 hours, the corpse rises as a <strong>Myconid Spore Servant</strong>. The corpse stays animate for [[/r 1d4 + 1]] weeks or until destroyed, and it can't be animated again in this way.</p>",
